    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the new &quot;Sight&quot;, &quot;Shiyuan: Tracing the Light&quot; is an original stealth adventure, platform level game, and has a profound plot that explores the concept of &quot;existence&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the field of sight, you will transform into the existence of &quot;what you want to be&quot; and meet the gods that cannot be seen in reality, and they have already changed into your favorite form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the protagonist of the work, his wish is to no longer suffer from the suffering of &quot;human suffering&quot;. He envied the free and unrestrained birds in his childhood, and now he has achieved his dream of becoming a Hillstar hummingbird!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/1616b42af5549ea4a0250cb47ad00f53.poster.avif?t=1746359857\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/1616b42af5549ea4a0250cb47ad00f53.webm?t=1746359857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/1616b42af5549ea4a0250cb47ad00f53.mp4?t=1746359857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/85a90862ad6957813cad94c1e5bad65b.poster.avif?t=1746359857\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/85a90862ad6957813cad94c1e5bad65b.webm?t=1746359857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/85a90862ad6957813cad94c1e5bad65b.mp4?t=1746359857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But! He became the only example in the world of the Hillstar hummingbird population ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, at the moment of the extinction of the hummingbird tribe, in the flight of &quot;freedom&quot;, he arrived at the Flower God Altar. The power of the Flower God is to &quot;spread and breed&quot;. With her help, save the Housta hummingbird!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The thrilling experience in the forest breaks all previous game perceptions, and on the basis of platform jumping, you can even climb trees!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Diverse skill experiences, characters can use the &quot;mimicry&quot; feature to transform into various butterflies, each with different skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Defeat the strong with the weak, your protagonist is just a caterpillar (butterfly larva), but even a lion or tiger will definitely be defeated by you! (You can also choose to look for other ways)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Become a god, you can contribute your soul to summon gods, transform into a human body for battle, and during the transformation period, you will have unparalleled abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Smooth and silky operation experience, beautiful artistic style, bringing you a unique experience!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the new &quot;Sight&quot;, &quot;Shiyuan: Tracing the Light&quot; is an original stealth adventure, platform level game, and has a profound plot that explores the concept of &quot;existence&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the field of sight, you will transform into the existence of &quot;what you want to be&quot; and meet the gods that cannot be seen in reality, and they have already changed into your favorite form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the protagonist of the work, his wish is to no longer suffer from the suffering of &quot;human suffering&quot;. He envied the free and unrestrained birds in his childhood, and now he has achieved his dream of becoming a Hillstar hummingbird!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/1616b42af5549ea4a0250cb47ad00f53.poster.avif?t=1746359857\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/1616b42af5549ea4a0250cb47ad00f53.webm?t=1746359857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/1616b42af5549ea4a0250cb47ad00f53.mp4?t=1746359857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/85a90862ad6957813cad94c1e5bad65b.poster.avif?t=1746359857\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/85a90862ad6957813cad94c1e5bad65b.webm?t=1746359857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627880/extras/85a90862ad6957813cad94c1e5bad65b.mp4?t=1746359857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But! He became the only example in the world of the Hillstar hummingbird population ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, at the moment of the extinction of the hummingbird tribe, in the flight of &quot;freedom&quot;, he arrived at the Flower God Altar. The power of the Flower God is to &quot;spread and breed&quot;. With her help, save the Housta hummingbird!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The thrilling experience in the forest breaks all previous game perceptions, and on the basis of platform jumping, you can even climb trees!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Diverse skill experiences, characters can use the &quot;mimicry&quot; feature to transform into various butterflies, each with different skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Defeat the strong with the weak, your protagonist is just a caterpillar (butterfly larva), but even a lion or tiger will definitely be defeated by you! (You can also choose to look for other ways)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Become a god, you can contribute your soul to summon gods, transform into a human body for battle, and during the transformation period, you will have unparalleled abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Smooth and silky operation experience, beautiful artistic style, bringing you a unique experience!</p>",
    "short_description": "In the land of dreams, searching for the meaning of existence, everything once dreamed of is just illusory, only in the &quot;sight&quot; can we trace back to the light of life.",
